Modification Notice:
This directory contains a customized derivative of NVIDIA's nvdiffmodeling (and renderutils CUDA/C++ kernels) adapted by the OGD-LBS authors to support multi-component skeletal skinning (LBS), per-face mixed BSDF IDs, two-sided back-deepened diffuse shading, and body bone alpha masking.
